WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.060
P3.1 · Versions and what they freeze

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:09.115
A new version starts from the rules of the version it comes from.

3
00:00:09.165 --> 00:00:12.058
Editing one version never changes another.

4
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:26.054
Budgets are versions too: here FY2026, approved, next to the FY2027 and FY2028 drafts.

5
00:00:26.104 --> 00:00:29.495
Each budget goes through draft, submitted and approved.

6
00:00:30.645 --> 00:00:34.260
Name versions so that anyone can read them a year later.

